      "purpose": "Defines TypeScript-only profile and organization-related data shapes used to distinguish personal users, organization members, and profile identifiers.",
      "summary": "This declaration file models user profile variants through discriminating nullable fields rather than an explicit tag. It combines selected team metadata with requested organization slug information, describes organization-backed and personal profile records, and provides a string alias for identifiers that may represent either users or profiles.",
